      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْلَأَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A currier's knife, used for shaving the
inner surface of the hide:</i> (K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">محْلَأٌ</span></b>  the
<i>iron instrument, or stone, with which one shaves
off the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِحْلِىء</span> <i>of a hide, and with which one skins.</i>
